  "body": "If you've been searching for a property where you can roll up your sleeves, add value and create something special, 585 East Coast Road deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous, tree-lined section with a flat & sunny backyard, this is a home with plenty of potential. The current owner had big plans to transform the property, but with personal circumstances changing, it's time for someone else to take over the vision.\r\n\r\nThe main level offers a spacious living room plus an open-plan kitchen, dining and family area, with the dining flowing out to a covered deck. Also on this level is the master bedroom with ensuite, along with a separate powder room.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, you'll find two further bedrooms, two study rooms, a family bathroom, powder room and laundry. The downstairs bedrooms open directly out to the flat, sunny backyard - an ideal space for children to play, with established trees creating a lovely green outlook.\r\n\r\nThere's plenty here to work with. Modernise the kitchen and bathrooms, recarpet, repaint, add new drapes and build a new deck off the rear to really make the most of the outdoor space. Beneath the garage, block walls and framing are already in place for two additional rooms, currently unfinished - another project for the next owner to explore and complete, subject to any necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nParking is well catered for with a single garage and workshop space, carport and additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nAt a Glance-\r\n* Three bedrooms + two studies\r\n* Master with ensuite + family bathroom + two separate powder rooms\r\n* Two living areas + open-plan kitchen and dining & covered deck\r\n* Flat, sunny, tree-lined backyard\r\n* Single garage/workshop + carport + off-street parking\r\n* Brick façade over weatherboard\r\n* Two partly constructed, unfinished rooms beneath the garage\r\n* Huge scope to renovate, modernise and add value\r\n\r\nFor families, the location adds even more appeal. You're in zone for Rangitoto College, Pinehill School, Northcross Intermediate and Murrays Bay Intermediate, with Westfield Albany and the Greville Road motorway interchange just a quick drive away.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a home you can renovate for your family, or you love the idea of adding value and reaping the rewards, the opportunity here is clear.\r\n\r\nThe owner's plans have changed and this property needs to be sold.\r\n\r\nBring your vision, bring your ideas - and make 585 East Coast Road your next project.\r\n\r\nAuction: Thursday 29 October 2026 (Unless Sold Prior)\r\nLocation: Ray White Milford, in rooms 5:00pm\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35947",
